      "statement": "HO-3 2018-09 Exclusion C.2 excludes deterioration, mold, and wet or dry rot, while attached HO 04 81 M.1 writes back direct physical loss to Coverage A, B, or C property caused by fungi, wet/dry rot, or bacteria only when it results from a Section I insured peril occurring during the policy period; C.2 is displaced only to that extent.",
